<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1467711543"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:01.533"><div begin="22.053" end="49.971"><p begin="22.053" end="28.483" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.053" end="22.418">曾</span><span begin="22.418" end="23.352">听</span><span begin="23.352" end="23.758">说</span><span begin="23.851" end="24.751">过</span> <span begin="25.402" end="25.774">寻</span><span begin="25.774" end="26.782">觅</span><span begin="27.039" end="27.380">爱</span><span begin="27.380" end="28.483">情</span></p><p begin="29.707" end="35.695" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.707" end="30.610">就像</span><span begin="30.610" end="31.002">天</span><span begin="31.002" end="31.306">与</span><span begin="31.455" end="32.083">地</span><span begin="32.083" end="32.395">别</span><span begin="32.395" end="32.755">离</span><span begin="32.832" end="34.285">和重聚</span><span begin="34.285" end="34.589">过</span><span begin="34.589" end="35.695">程</span></p><p begin="36.466" end="43.018" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.466" end="36.680">而</span><span begin="36.680" end="37.682">我</span><span begin="37.958" end="38.479">跟</span><span begin="38.479" end="39.108">你</span> <span begin="39.715" end="40.139">平</span><span begin="40.139" end="41.525">静</span><span begin="41.525" end="41.952">旅</span><span begin="41.952" end="43.018">程</span></p><p begin="44.393" end="49.971" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.393" end="44.783">并</span><span begin="44.783" end="45.276">没</span><span begin="45.276" end="45.562">有</span><span begin="45.562" end="46.056">惊</span><span begin="46.056" end="46.585">心</span><span begin="46.585" end="46.949">也</span><span begin="46.949" end="47.492">没</span><span begin="47.492" end="47.953">动</span><span begin="47.953" end="48.756">魄的</span><span begin="48.756" end="49.276">情</span><span begin="49.276" end="49.971">境</span></p></div><div begin="50.229" end="1:26.104"><p begin="50.229" end="57.066" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agen